Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Magandang balita yan, Mr. Chairman.

984
01:16:57,860 --> 01:17:00,940
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mukhang malapit na tayo mapunta ng Surigao dito

985
01:17:00,940 --> 01:17:02,560
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: at saka kaya sa Cagayan de Oro.

986
01:17:02,620 --> 01:17:05,880
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Kaya masayang-masaya ang pinsan ko si Kong Rufus.

987
01:17:07,240 --> 01:17:08,380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, ilang-ilang...

988
01:17:09,300 --> 01:17:11,780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sorry po, Minority.

989
01:17:11,940 --> 01:17:14,660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Speaking of that po, Honorable Chairman,

990
01:17:15,000 --> 01:17:18,940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ine-next na po natin yung Southern Leyte to Surigao.

991
01:17:20,260 --> 01:17:24,920
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Chairman, may budget ngayon sa NIP natin na

992
01:17:25,580 --> 01:17:33,400
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: P350 million for feasibility study for Mindanao-Leyte Bridge Link.

993
01:17:34,100 --> 01:17:38,100
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: So napakaganda nitong dalawang proyekto.

994
01:17:38,160 --> 01:17:41,840
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Anyway, ilang kilometro po ba ang nangyayari

995
01:17:41,840 --> 01:17:45,720
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: pag ginawa natin itong Dinalupihan, yung Allen

996
01:17:45,740 --> 01:17:50,960
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Dinalupihan, Capul, Matnog, or Sorsogon Bridge?

997
01:17:51,140 --> 01:17:52,280
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Nagiging ilang kilometro?

998
01:17:52,360 --> 01:17:53,120
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Together with the...

999
01:17:53,120 --> 01:17:55,160
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Yung nasa isla...

1000
01:17:55,160 --> 01:17:58,200
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Yung nasa isla po na dadaan sa dalawang isla.

1001
01:17:58,220 --> 01:18:00,140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: It is roughly about 20 kilometers.

1002
01:18:00,680 --> 01:18:01,960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: It will be the...

1003
01:18:02,720 --> 01:18:04,360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Once it is done,

1004
01:18:04,520 --> 01:18:08,880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: and once the Bataan-Cavite Link Bridge is done,

1005
01:18:09,080 --> 01:18:11,780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: it will be the second longest bridge in the country.

1006
01:18:11,820 --> 01:18:14,200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Second to Bataan-Cavite Link Bridge.

1007
01:18:14,520 --> 01:18:17,080
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: So, Mr. Chairman, mas maiksi pala ito

1008
01:18:17,080 --> 01:18:20,320
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: kaysa Bataan-Cavite Bridge.

1009
01:18:20,720 --> 01:18:21,480
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mas maiksi ito.

1010
01:18:21,500 --> 01:18:22,760
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: 20 kilometers lang ito.

1011
01:18:23,420 --> 01:18:25,060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Ang pangatlong tanong, Mr. Chairman,

1012
01:18:26,120 --> 01:18:28,240
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: sa economic rate of return,

1013
01:18:28,900 --> 01:18:31,760
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: itong napaka-importante pag mag-de-decide tayo

1014
01:18:31,760 --> 01:18:33,620
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ng ganitong mega-structures,

1015
01:18:34,060 --> 01:18:37,020
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ano ang mas malaking economic rate of return?

1016
01:18:37,280 --> 01:18:42,600
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Yung Cavite-Bataan Bridge or yung Sorsogon-Samar Bridge Link?

1017
01:18:43,000 --> 01:18:46,160
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Chairman, maganda po yung...

1018
01:18:46,160 --> 01:18:47,300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Napakaganda po yung tanong.

1019
01:18:47,440 --> 01:18:50,640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Again po, Maharlika network po ito

1020
01:18:50,640 --> 01:18:55,100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kasi Sorsogon ay Bicol to Northern Samar.

1021
01:18:56,100 --> 01:18:58,880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mataas po ang Cavite-Bataan Link Bridge.

1022
01:18:59,080 --> 01:19:02,320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 33% po ang economic rate of return.

1023
01:19:02,580 --> 01:19:06,040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero po ang Bicol to Samar Link Bridge

1024
01:19:06,040 --> 01:19:08,620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ay 42% economic rate of return.

1025
01:19:08,860 --> 01:19:15,780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mas mataas pa po ang Sorsogon to Northern Samar Link Bridge

1026
01:19:15,780 --> 01:19:16,580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: economic rate of return.

1027
01:19:16,800 --> 01:19:18,600
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: I think ito po ang isa sa mga pinakamataas

1028
01:19:18,600 --> 01:19:20,860
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na economic rate of return na bridges.

1029
01:19:21,060 --> 01:19:24,440
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Secretary, baka hindi naisama ang tourism aspect.

1030
01:19:24,440 --> 01:19:28,180
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: In your evaluation, please check on that.

1031
01:19:28,840 --> 01:19:30,240
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Para madagdag doon sa IRR.

1032
01:19:32,020 --> 01:19:34,420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We will do that, Mr. Chairman. Thank you.

1033
01:19:34,940 --> 01:19:36,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero mataas po talaga.

1034
01:19:37,100 --> 01:19:41,300
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Chairman, kaya apat na taon po ako nag-iingay dito

1035
01:19:41,300 --> 01:19:44,540
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: dahil pag gusto natin gumadang ating bansa,

1036
01:19:44,620 --> 01:19:47,480
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: tumbukin natin yung mga tamang problema ng ating bansa.

1037
01:19:47,680 --> 01:19:52,260
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Masaya ko nandyan ang ating Secretary of Public Works and Highways

1038
01:19:52,260 --> 01:19:54,420
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na napakasipag at nakikita niya ito.

1039
01:19:54,880 --> 01:19:56,880
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Ang susunod na tanong, Mr. Chairman,

1040
01:19:57,160 --> 01:19:58,800
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ang timeline natin.

1041
01:19:58,840 --> 01:20:02,400
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Kasi kung makaari magawa ito sa panahon ni Presidente Bongbong Marcos,

1042
01:20:02,520 --> 01:20:04,880
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: napaka-importante po na tulay na ito.

1043
01:20:04,980 --> 01:20:06,800
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Ano po ba ang timeline?

1044
01:20:09,340 --> 01:20:12,400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Unfortunately po, mukhang hindi natin magagawa ito

1045
01:20:12,400 --> 01:20:15,540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: within the next two years or one year.

1046
01:20:15,540 --> 01:20:19,780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: A little less than two years na today.

1047
01:20:20,860 --> 01:20:23,700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero po, ito po ang tingin kong makukomit natin.

1048
01:20:24,000 --> 01:20:24,580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Na pagkatapos,

1049
01:20:24,600 --> 01:20:28,000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pagkatapos po kasi ng feasibility study na ginagawa ito.

1050
01:20:28,440 --> 01:20:29,360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang next step po,

1051
01:20:29,460 --> 01:20:34,720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang feasibility study po siguro matatapos na by next year,

1052
01:20:34,840 --> 01:20:37,080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 2027 po, matatapos na natin yung FS.

1053
01:20:37,660 --> 01:20:41,940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang next step po natin dito ay makahanap po ng funding source.

1054
01:20:42,160 --> 01:20:47,460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil hindi po biro ang... at wala po po akong magbibigay na estimated cost dito.

1055
01:20:47,920 --> 01:20:49,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero tingin ko po,

1056
01:20:49,180 --> 01:20:52,460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at nakausap na po namin ang malalaking funding agencies,

1057
01:20:52,760 --> 01:20:53,480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang ADB,

1058
01:20:53,600 --> 01:20:55,140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang Korea,

1059
01:20:55,480 --> 01:20:56,560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang JICA,

1060
01:20:56,860 --> 01:20:59,260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang AIIB,

1061
01:20:59,340 --> 01:21:01,280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kamukha po nung Bataan Cavite,

1062
01:21:01,280 --> 01:21:04,260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: which is jointly financed by ADB and AIIB.

1063
01:21:04,740 --> 01:21:10,760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: They have expressed very, very strong interest to funding this.

1064
01:21:10,760 --> 01:21:16,220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Simply because of the very, very high economic rate of return.

1065
01:21:16,220 --> 01:21:18,280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Na higher pa po than Bataan Cavite.

1066
01:21:18,800 --> 01:21:21,900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tingin ko po, hindi po tayo magkakaproblemang makahanap ng funding.

1067
01:21:21,900 --> 01:21:25,460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And if we can get funding and we can get final approval,

1068
01:21:25,460 --> 01:21:32,940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: approval of the DepDev board or the Economic Development Council before the end of the term,

1069
01:21:33,260 --> 01:21:38,700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: maglaking bagay na po ito at ipapasa na natin po yung construction nito sa susunod na administration.

1070
01:21:38,700 --> 01:21:42,880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I think the timeline for construction is six years po.

1071
01:21:43,220 --> 01:21:45,940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang timeline for construction is six years.

1072
01:21:46,400 --> 01:21:51,920
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Anyway, Mr. Chairman, may gestation period dito pagkawa ng feasibility study.

1073
01:21:52,640 --> 01:21:55,060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi naman natin pwedeng madaliin ito.

1074
01:21:55,080 --> 01:21:59,020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero wars are won based on plans, according to Sun Tzu, diba?

1075
01:21:59,340 --> 01:22:03,620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pag maganda ang plano natin, may funding source na, tapos na yan.

1076
01:22:04,140 --> 01:22:04,460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Diba?

1077
01:22:04,660 --> 01:22:06,940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi implementation na lang ang susunod.

1078
01:22:06,940 --> 01:22:15,480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya, Mr. Chairman, patuloy lang tayo na suportahan ang magandang mga proyekto na makakaganda sa ating bansa.

1079
01:22:15,600 --> 01:22:21,440
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At congratulations, Sir Vince, sa inyong masusing pag-aaral nito.

1080
01:22:21,880 --> 01:22:24,440
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At asahan nyo po ang aming suporta.

1081
01:22:24,440 --> 01:22:28,420
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Para matuluyang magawa ng ang proyekto nito.

1082
01:22:28,700 --> 01:22:34,160
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Maraming salamat, Secretary Vince Dizon, at saka maraming salamat, Mr. Chairman.

1083
01:22:36,060 --> 01:22:39,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Congratulations, Minority Leader.

1084
01:22:39,660 --> 01:22:42,440
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Talagang tutuloy na yung program mo, project mo.

1085
01:22:42,640 --> 01:22:43,720
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Tutuloy na natin yan.

1086
01:22:44,060 --> 01:22:46,380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Well, thank you so much, Mr. Chairman.

1087
01:22:46,480 --> 01:22:49,080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: if I just may add one sentence na lang po.

1088
01:22:49,180 --> 01:22:49,660
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Ah, yes, yes.

1089
01:22:50,100 --> 01:22:55,060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dati po yung Bataan Cavite, kaya po panaginip lang po yun.

1090
01:22:55,060 --> 01:23:01,280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero I'm happy to report po na the two approaches are already ongoing construction.

1091
01:23:01,760 --> 01:23:10,620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And we will be awarding the major span of the Bataan Cavite Link Bridge within the month of September.

1092
01:23:10,720 --> 01:23:14,980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ito po yung sa gitna ng Manila Bay na critical path po, yung P6

1093
01:23:15,960 --> 01:23:19,280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And we will be awarding that very soon po in September.

1094
01:23:19,540 --> 01:23:21,720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, hindi na po panaginip. Totoo na po yun.

1095
01:23:21,720 --> 01:23:23,280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And tingin ko po, yun din po ang mangyayari

1096
01:23:23,280 --> 01:23:25,520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa

1097
01:23:25,520 --> 01:23:27,140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sorsogon to Samar Bridge.

1098
01:23:27,380 --> 01:23:27,860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you po.

1099
01:23:27,940 --> 01:23:32,120
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Mr. Secretary, for your information.

1100
01:23:32,940 --> 01:23:33,920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next to...

1101
01:23:33,920 --> 01:23:35,740
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next to...

1102
01:23:37,440 --> 01:23:38,380
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Interpellate, Honorable Toby Tiangco.

1103
01:23:40,800 --> 01:23:42,200
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: From the Independent.

1104
01:23:45,520 --> 01:23:46,720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yes, Mr. Chair.

1105
01:23:46,900 --> 01:23:47,880
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Thank you.

1106
01:23:47,940 --> 01:23:52,360
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: First of all, I appreciate, no, Sec. Vince, lahat ng tulong niyo po sa Navotas.

1107
01:23:53,260 --> 01:23:55,080
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Congratulations at maraming salamat.

1108
01:23:55,320 --> 01:23:56,320
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Mr. Chair, um...

1109
01:23:57,670 --> 01:24:02,820
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Ang problema po natin hanggang ngayon po, nandiyan pa rin po yung issue ng corruption sa infrastructure projects.

1110
01:24:03,660 --> 01:24:10,040
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Tuwing magbabaha, iniisip po ng mga tao, kaya sila binaha, ay dahil sa corruption at minakaw po ang pondo.

1111
01:24:11,100 --> 01:24:14,460
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kung gusto nating labanan ng corruption, dalawang bagay po ang kailangan.

1112
01:24:15,260 --> 01:24:16,920
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Accountability and transparency.

1113
01:24:17,720 --> 01:24:23,600
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: And when we say transparency, it cannot be selective transparency, it has to be full transparency.

1114
01:24:24,320 --> 01:24:25,520
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Mr. Chair, my question is premised

1115
01:24:25,520 --> 01:24:27,240
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: sa matagal ko nang

1116
01:24:27,920 --> 01:24:37,240
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: na matagal ko lang rinirequest, na lahat po ng DPW8 projects per Congressional Legislative District at per Party List Representative ay mapublish.

1117
01:24:37,600 --> 01:24:43,840
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Una ko po itong binanggit noong October 13, 2025, sa botohan ng third reading ng HGAP.

1118
01:24:44,180 --> 01:24:48,480
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Sumunod po, sumulat po ako kay Chairwoman Swan Singh, October 20, 2025.

1119
01:24:48,480 --> 01:24:57,360
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: And as you recall po, nung nahandun po tayo sa DBCC, binanggit ko po ito nung unang araw ng budget briefing ng Agosto

1120
01:24:57,360 --> 01:24:59,120
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: 17, 2026.

1121
01:24:59,980 --> 01:25:07,880
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kaya po napakahalaga nito dahil sa pagkukumpara ay makikita kung may lumobong o bumukol na distrito.

1122
01:25:08,260 --> 01:25:10,880
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Balikan po natin yung 2025, ha.

1123
01:25:11,340 --> 01:25:17,400
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yung mga nakita pong ghost project at substandards ay doon po sa mga distrito ang lumobo ang budget.

1124
01:25:17,400 --> 01:25:20,000
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So, warning sign po yan, pwede nating pigilan.

1125
01:25:20,380 --> 01:25:23,420
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kung naging transparent lang po tayo noon, ay maiiwasan ito.

1126
01:25:24,060 --> 01:25:25,400
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kaya ang tanong ko po ngayon,

1127
01:25:26,340 --> 01:25:31,860
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: ay na-publish yung NEPR District for 2027.

1128
01:25:33,960 --> 01:25:35,280
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Sa inyo po yan, Mr. Chairman, hindi po kay Sec. Vince.

1129
01:25:35,900 --> 01:25:36,820
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yeah.

1130
01:25:38,660 --> 01:25:44,560
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: I would rather refer this to the Chairman herself.

1131
01:25:44,560 --> 01:25:54,320
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And probably this will bring out during the discussion of the Committee of Appropriation in Asihol.

1132
01:25:54,320 --> 01:25:57,340
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Para siguro masagot na natin.

1133
01:25:57,640 --> 01:26:16,940
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Or matugunan yung request na i-publish yung previous at saka yung ngayon ng mga allocations per districts and regions.

1134
01:26:17,600 --> 01:26:23,100
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: However, offhand, I can say that it's quite transparent naman.

1135
01:26:24,360 --> 01:26:30,660
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Dahil una, it was published in the portal of DBM.

1136
01:26:30,660 --> 01:26:34,000
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: As well as, in the portal of the DPWH.

1137
01:26:34,360 --> 01:26:40,260
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So mayroon kayong portal diyan na ma-access

1138
01:26:40,260 --> 01:26:44,800
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: kung sino man at makita nila by district, by regions, yung allocations.

1139
01:26:44,800 --> 01:26:49,440
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: From 2027 down, siguro mayroon kayo.

1140
01:26:50,460 --> 01:26:52,620
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Do you have that, Mr. Secretary?

1141
01:26:53,420 --> 01:26:58,580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, with your permission, with the permission of Congressman Toby.

1142
01:26:58,680 --> 01:27:01,640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo, tama po yan. Unang-una po.

1143
01:27:01,640 --> 01:27:02,940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ulitin ko lang po yung website.

1144
01:27:02,940 --> 01:27:11,860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: It is www.transparency.dpwh.gov.ph

1145
01:27:11,860 --> 01:27:16,820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Lahat po ng projects ng DPWH, whether, I think from the past 10 years,

1146
01:27:16,820 --> 01:27:25,200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: including all ongoing, are there, including all documents, contracts, plans, lahat po nandyan.

1147
01:27:25,200 --> 01:27:30,760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pati po yung links to the procurement, yung mga bidding po natin.

1148
01:27:31,560 --> 01:27:33,460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nag-live na nasa YouTube, nandyan po yan.

1149
01:27:33,460 --> 01:27:37,460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But I just want to tell po the Chairman and Congressman Toby that

1150
01:27:37,460 --> 01:27:43,280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: we will be uploading the NEP, the entire NEP of DPWH into the portal.

1151
01:27:43,280 --> 01:27:48,360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Together with all supporting documents po sa NEP.

1152
01:27:48,360 --> 01:27:52,140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Para kasi open po ito.

1153
01:27:52,140 --> 01:27:56,160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi lang po sa ating members, honorable members, kundi pati sa publiko.

1154
01:27:56,160 --> 01:27:57,620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Salamat po, Mr. Chairman.

1155
01:27:57,720 --> 01:28:00,280
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Mr. Chair,

1156
01:28:00,280 --> 01:28:01,400
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Totoo po nasa NEP po yan.

1157
01:28:01,400 --> 01:28:04,420
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Pero ang tanong, madali bang hanapin ng ating constituents?

1158
01:28:04,420 --> 01:28:07,200
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kung kayo po, tatanungin ko po kayo, Mr. Chair.

1159
01:28:07,200 --> 01:28:15,320
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Magkano po ang NEP ng Lone District of Navotas City?

1160
01:28:15,320 --> 01:28:18,660
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kasi kayo po ang nagsabi noong last meeting natin na madaling hanapin.

1161
01:28:18,660 --> 01:28:20,440
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Ito po yung NEP.

1162
01:28:20,440 --> 01:28:21,360
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: 722 pages.

1163
01:28:21,360 --> 01:28:23,720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kung hahanapin nyo lang po ang isang distrito,

1164
01:28:23,720 --> 01:28:27,900
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: bakit naman kailangan basahin ng mamamayan yung 722 pages?

1165
01:28:27,900 --> 01:28:31,420
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Hindi pa dapat po madali niyang basahin.

1166
01:28:31,420 --> 01:28:31,960
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Actually, tama.

1167
01:28:31,960 --> 01:28:36,680
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Si Congressman Tobi, mahirap talaga sa ordinary na tao,

1168
01:28:36,680 --> 01:28:42,540
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: mahirap hanapin ang allocations by district in the NEP.

1169
01:28:42,540 --> 01:28:47,940
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So that's why, siguro, I would suggest to the Department of Public Works and Highways

1170
01:28:47,940 --> 01:28:57,120
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: that you will publish it by region and by district with equivalent amount.

1171
01:28:57,460 --> 01:28:58,040
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Sige po.

1172
01:28:58,040 --> 01:28:59,360
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Meron lang po akong pinakita.

1173
01:28:59,360 --> 01:29:01,080
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kasi doon po sa website,

1174
01:29:01,080 --> 01:29:04,080
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: hindi ko alam bakit pa natin kailangan tanungin si Chair.

1175
01:29:05,180 --> 01:29:09,100
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Doon po sa website ng Congress, nakasulat po na ipapublish.

1176
01:29:09,260 --> 01:29:09,660
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: I agree.

1177
01:29:09,760 --> 01:29:12,160
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yan po, kayo na po mismo bumasa.

1178
01:29:12,160 --> 01:29:19,040
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kung ano po nakasabi dyan.

1179
01:29:19,600 --> 01:29:23,720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: The BARSC shall immediately publish reports in the House website

1180
01:29:23,720 --> 01:29:28,080
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: on budgetary allocations per government, agency, and each legislative district.

1181
01:29:28,080 --> 01:29:32,800
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Pero yung last year po hanggang ngayon, yung 2026 GAA,

1182
01:29:32,800 --> 01:29:38,340
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: hanggang ngayon po hindi pinapublish, pero sinasabi po sa website, ipapublish natin.

1183
01:29:38,340 --> 01:29:38,820
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So bakit wala?

1184
01:29:48,900 --> 01:29:49,380
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: What happened po?

1185
01:29:49,380 --> 01:29:52,680
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Well, I will just refer this to the Chair.

1186
01:29:53,500 --> 01:29:56,560
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kung napublish ba o hindi talaga yan, Honorable Toby.

1187
01:29:56,560 --> 01:30:01,680
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: But I agree with you that this should have been published already. Or at least makita ng lahat, hindi lang tayo, kung hindi ang lahat ng mga kababayan natin sa ating mga distrito.

1188
01:30:07,840 --> 01:30:13,180
